{"name": "Hextalia", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"548\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/7717b412a3de4e11af94ebaaf621de89.poster.avif?t=1785771705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/7717b412a3de4e11af94ebaaf621de89.webm?t=1785771705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/7717b412a3de4e11af94ebaaf621de89.mp4?t=1785771705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hextalia is a hex-based tower defense strategy game where the path is part of your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build pillars, place towers, grow your build with strategic choices, and reshape the board to defend the world of Hextalia from the spreading Hexrot. Every run requires you to adapt as you go: where the next wave will strike, how to bend the enemy path to your advantage, which synergies can carry your strategy, and when it is time to change the entire shape of your defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras_big/de680bd7cbedb5afb4975e71d42c2cf0.webp?t=1785771705\" height=\"233\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/de680bd7cbedb5afb4975e71d42c2cf0.avif?t=1785771705\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In Hextalia, towers do more than attack. They change the shape of the battlefield.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Towers being placed in successive order, shaping the path around them\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"548\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/fb21a5c209cae493b761d523484d0270.poster.avif?t=1785771705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/fb21a5c209cae493b761d523484d0270.webm?t=1785771705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/fb21a5c209cae493b761d523484d0270.mp4?t=1785771705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every tower you place can redirect the enemy path, forcing waves to move around your defenses instead of marching straight toward their goal. <br/>Cut off direct routes, push enemies sideways, extend the path, and guide them through the killing ground you prepared. <br/><br/>Range matters, but the real power is in the layout: <strong>shape the path</strong> around your towers, <strong>chain their effects</strong> together, and turn movement itself into <strong>part of your strategy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras_big/ed20166a27b7e871f627b2338d73d1bf.webp?t=1785771705\" height=\"233\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/ed20166a27b7e871f627b2338d73d1bf.avif?t=1785771705\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your build takes shape one choice at a time.</strong><br/> <br/> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"548\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/c0d8cfc4cc53a133e2e914d87fad47b8.poster.avif?t=1785771705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/c0d8cfc4cc53a133e2e914d87fad47b8.webm?t=1785771705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/c0d8cfc4cc53a133e2e914d87fad47b8.mp4?t=1785771705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the level unfolds, choose from cards that add new towers, improve your defenses, or unlock special abilities that change how your strategy works. Each pick can strengthen a synergy, cover a weakness, or push your build in a new direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The best builds are discovered, adjusted, and pushed as far as you can take them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Know Your Enemies\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras_big/eb61209123607afb11715a6a6672ad24.webp?t=1785771705\" height=\"233\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/eb61209123607afb11715a6a6672ad24.avif?t=1785771705\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Some enemies rush. Some resist. Some ruin the plan you thought was safe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"3 videos showing different enemies and their special abilities - A bat's screech causing confusion to towers. Bobbers digging underground and an Ice King freezing towers.\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/6bf5b8159bf405f613f76870690a7c91.poster.avif?t=1785771705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/6bf5b8159bf405f613f76870690a7c91.webm?t=1785771705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/6bf5b8159bf405f613f76870690a7c91.mp4?t=1785771705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level throws a different mix of threats at you, and careless builds get punished fast.   <br/>Read what is coming, reshape the route, and adjust your strategy before the wave breaks through.   <br/> <br/>The more you understand your enemies, the better you can turn their strengths against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras_big/7bf473f4fdd0abf071cc7002cdbd7483.webp?t=1785771705\" height=\"233\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/7bf473f4fdd0abf071cc7002cdbd7483.avif?t=1785771705\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Hexrot is spreading, corrupting lands and creatures across Hextalia.</strong><br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"A map scroll appear, and then opens across a table with a woodland biome appearing in 3D on top\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"548\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/408baf0fe579b4c85395995240d571d6.poster.avif?t=1785771705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/408baf0fe579b4c85395995240d571d6.webm?t=1785771705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/408baf0fe579b4c85395995240d571d6.mp4?t=1785771705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel across a world of diverse regions, commanding the battlefield as you push back the corruption. Move through unique biomes, defend forgotten places, and face new challenges as the Hexrot continues to spread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each battle brings you one step further into the fight to reclaim Hextalia and restore the world before it is consumed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras_big/65f86999665bfd841dad86e02626a6b1.webp?t=1785771705\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/65f86999665bfd841dad86e02626a6b1.avif?t=1785771705\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 <strong>Shape the battlefield. Build your strategy. Push back the Hexrot. Hextalia\u2019s fate is in your hands.</strong>\u00a0\u00a0<br/>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras_big/045f80f37ff039776b2d49bb0805a389.webp?t=1785771705\" height=\"413\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/045f80f37ff039776b2d49bb0805a389.avif?t=1785771705\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Hextalia is a hex-based strategic Tower Defense where you get maximum control over the board. Build pillars to shape the paths of your enemies, experiment with endless build combinations, and discover different levels-each comes with its own unique challenge.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/1bb509e58cfc7d8d792da0ca89cd38ab5c4571ca/header.jpg?t=1785771705", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Tower Defense", "Strategy", "Hex Grid", "Building", "Puzzle", "Real Time Tactics"], "developers": "EpLap Studio", "publishers": "EpLap Studio", "release_date": "Q1 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3734940", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 October 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/pzSJyL-0Gfg", "first_seen": 1760047200.0, "review_rank": 1455}